*.pyc

# Real, machine-specific config (domains, SSH targets, login credentials).
# Copy config.example.json -> config.json and edit it; never commit config.json.
config.json

# Real Cloudflare tunnel config (tunnel ID + real hostnames). Copy
# cloudflared-config.example.yml and edit it for your own tunnel.
cloudflared-config-ntfy.yml

# Claude Code's per-project operational memory: a running journal of this
# specific deployment (real IPs, hostnames, incident notes). Not for publishing.
PROJECT_MEMORY.md

# Stray build artifacts that shouldn't be tracked even if regenerated.
server.py.new

# Sanitisation writeup: it documents what was removed BY QUOTING the real
# values (ssh targets, tailnet IPs, domain, a live vuln note), so it must never
# be published. Kept locally for reference.
PUBLISHING_GUIDE.md
